==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* The [[Shadow Triad]] attack {{DL|Nacrene City|Nacrene Museum}}.
* The [[Gym Leader]]s, apart from [[Brycen]], are captured by the Shadow Triad.
* [[Team Plasma]] snatch the [[Dark Stone]].
* [[N]] awakens {{p|Zekrom}}.
* {{p|Reshiram}} chooses {{adv|Black}} as its hero.
* Black meets Drayden.
* {{adv|White}} meets {{adv|Bianca}} again and receives her [[Pokédex]].
* Black begins his battle with Brycen.

